    "text": {
     "en": "(additional, not in the textbook) A noun is a naming word. It names a person, place, animal or thing.\nRavi, girl and teacher name people. Delhi and school are places.\nDog and bird are animals. Book and ball are things.\nFind the nouns in a sentence: Moti is a dog. The nouns are Moti and dog.\nCapital letters start the names of special people and places."
